Modifications include:
- Renamed EvalSurv to SurvMetrics
- Added new methods: auc_ipcw, integrated_auc_ipcw,
  concordance_td_ipcw, concordance_td_ipcw_truncated,
  integrated_brier_score_truncated, integrated_nbll_truncated,
  integrated_auc_ipcw_truncated
- Added internal helper methods for safe metric computation
  (_safe_run, _safe_scalar_metric, _safe_curve_metric, etc.)
- Added logging support
